== owner (exit 2)
ESCALATE OWNER b0: which model? (drive.nika SHA)
WAKE OWNER read=T/b0.report.md do=tell the owner the question, then restart the driver: ESCALATE OWNER b0: which model? (drive.nika SHA)
== unknown (exit 2)
ESCALATE no action for: BATCH none (no batch.txt) (drive.nika SHA)
WAKE ESCALATE read=- do=fix the cause it names, then restart the driver: ESCALATE no action for: BATCH none (no batch.txt) (drive.nika SHA)
